To complete all the missions leading to the main objective, the hero must travel to various corners of the globe, including Pakistan, Bosnia, Somalia, and the Philippines. In addition to the intriguing single-player campaign, Medal of Honor Warfighter features a thrilling global multiplayer mode, pitting two teams against each other. Players can choose from several nations, units, and character classes. This diversity definitely makes the multiplayer game just as exciting as the single-player version. Good luck to all soldiers!

